bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/47d885edc6a331bfcf86d480e6e58c45.webp?t=1788267968\" width=621 height=61 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/14c3b269413059512b0d1c9b8678a458.poster.avif?t=1788267968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/14c3b269413059512b0d1c9b8678a458.webm?t=1788267968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/14c3b269413059512b0d1c9b8678a458.mp4?t=1788267968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Bring light to the darkness, shine through the pitch-black Deep, and cleanse the corruption brought upon by unknown horrors and the wills of the gods. Tread carefully, and may your prayers illuminate the dangerous path to salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/b929c70f8388ac1c6926a22bf7a240fb.webp?t=1788267968\" width=621 height=61 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/f44676fef752ce726a8191ca44dc9d8b.poster.avif?t=1788267968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/f44676fef752ce726a8191ca44dc9d8b.webm?t=1788267968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/f44676fef752ce726a8191ca44dc9d8b.mp4?t=1788267968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your memory is shrouded in fog – you have no idea who you are or what transpired in your past. However, the place you're returning to holds the keys, offering snippets that will guide you to the truth – if you're strong enough to face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/extras/dedfa5660b326d18a9a88a4b4cd3a9ba.webp?t=1788267968\" width=621 height=61 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Uncover the Secret of the Deep in the first chapter of the Esantirion saga and face the evil beneath. Fight for hope, discover the past and become a hero in this action-adventure with a unique blend of RPG elements, hack’n’slash combat, resource management, and a gripping story!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Polish, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/039b811295eeeb8a45ddd496d17b1afe5b069e4e/header.jpg?t=1788267968", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/e9abad4f3cd4159b6a85900854e0a9c36e769010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788267968", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709410/e9abad4f3cd4159b6a85900854e0a9c36e769010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788267968", "website": "https://www.esanti.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or AMD RADEON RX 580 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<